<item><title>COP31 ends without global deal on climate finance sought by Tunisia</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/cop31-ends-without-global-deal-on-climate-finance-sought-by-e26290/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/cop31-ends-without-global-deal-on-climate-finance-sought-by-e26290/</guid><category>Tunisia</category><description>Tunisia estimates $55 billion in climate-finance needs for 2026-2035, including $10.7 billion for water and about $8 billion for agriculture.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 07:46:44 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" length="31271" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Tunisia’s feminist movement loses co-founder Amel Ben Aba</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-s-feminist-movement-loses-co-founder-amel-ben-aba-0b8a09/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-s-feminist-movement-loses-co-founder-amel-ben-aba-0b8a09/</guid><category>Tunisia</category><description>The left-wing activist and journalist, who was imprisoned in the 1970s, helped establish the Tunisian Association of Democratic Women.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 07:26:02 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" length="31271" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
